From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:18:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Map: ~80 draft Goa facilities, versioned hospitals reseed

- seedHospitals grown from 6 samples to 80 Goa facilities collected from public pages (draft, not field-verified)
- Excluded rows flagged CHECK, defence and port-trust facilities; four official facilities without coordinates keep a town-level position marked "(approx. location)"
- Phone numbers only where clean in the official DHS list
- firstRun: HOSPITALS_VERSION reloads the hospitals table when the list changes (nothing else stores a hospitalId)
- docs/goa_health_facilities_draft.csv keeps source and confidence per row

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LySrt3MdxnsvfXNsE9V7jF
